sequenceDiagram
    participant Admin as AppLove Admin
    participant Token as ParticipationToken
    participant Apple as App Store Connect
    participant Oracle as Revenue Oracle
    participant Registry as RevenueRegistry
    participant Vault as PayoutVault
    participant Holder as Participant
    Admin->>Token: Create series and issue demo units
    Token-->>Holder: Assign participation units
    Oracle->>Apple: Request authorized reports
    Apple-->>Oracle: Return financial data
    Oracle->>Oracle: Normalize and validate
    Oracle->>Registry: Submit authenticated attestation
    Registry->>Registry: Validate and finalize after review
    Admin->>Vault: Fund period with mock USDC
    Vault->>Registry: Read finalized revenue record
    Vault->>Token: Read eligible participation snapshot
    Vault->>Vault: Allocate funded distribution
    Holder->>Vault: Claim distribution
    Vault-->>Holder: Transfer mock USDC
